<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-27T05:12:49.123Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:12:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somali federal forces and U.S. airstrikes have killed dozens of al-Shabaab militants in Lower Shabelle, while Turkish-made missiles were identified in a deadly airstrike in Puntland, linking the conflict to external weapon supplies. The Somali government warned that Houthi support could boost al-Shabaab's attack capabilities, and the parliament speaker accused Kenya, Ethiopia and Uganda of colluding with the group, while the president blamed the UAE for financing armed groups. Foreign troops are beginning to withdraw, raising concerns that al-Shabaab could expand its influence. The United States has reversed its funding for international military support to Somalia. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168874&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5kNXpUczBINW1hMjFsNnhVWGpYZVFjR0FjV1ZwOGU1QmVjLW4wNnE2RnlUNnVxNGttbkU0S0x4NzJsbWhacmE2MG9pcTRzN0IwNGNJQkx4RVYyYnZlTnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPRUZ0S1o1NzlIS09jT1BUUmJMQjlkcTQ1bUhwZkJoaHVHYTFkbjFzT3ZVQmF6YW1JYWJvbTdNZUZ0VTdGTmdiU1dXbU9IRU9vc3dGcUFBd3kwd3dpVnVKMmFXYWNFa09rUGtzZHVBZEJ1LXZjS09udVlQS0N5V3RYaUVWWHgtenBRVzlDN2JBVWVqZWNvTjdnUVR6b2VxMW9iejhudV9vcktiZ05NRU16YVVJUFlEUXZwM214WGdSVGVxUF9MellSakZLUlFFZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQb0NESnpHdm9EdW5UdlNyTGFQZkExMFdHYklPSWFXOFdjeTlaeFJFT2tpTTd0eFl1NWNOSFJGdUJtNk1qQ0NVd0JabVhKNHZUaDlsbHJlTlJOUTRnajQtbFFKaVBxT2FMZEJRUllWNGVZZTVRZ1BTSUpnTGpTdWVySVc4cVN4Vm